OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer 'thankful to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter falling through roof at work
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 80 people have died and more
OL,7,Fthan 1,800 people have suffered major
OL,8,Finjuries in workplace accidents across
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland during the last five
OL,10,Fyears.
